From: Gleb Radchenko <14540409+GlebRadchenko@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:15:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] metal: fuse CONCAT + CPY + SSM_CONV (short conv with
 its state store); inkling2: legacy message queries stacked at load

2969 -> 2586 dispatches per decode token, A/B tg64 33.5 -> 35.1 tok/s. Bit-exact: KLD vs CPU unchanged (0.001285 ub 512, 0.001206 ub 1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
